# SlotWise — what never enters the API image.
#
# Two reasons a line is here: size, or it has no business on a server.

# --- scraped data and live session state -----------------------------------
# 16 MB of raw course HTML. Only reparse.py reads it, and reparse is not a
# hosted operation.
data/raw/
# 21 MB of one machine's locally scraped store. Gitignored, so a clean checkout
# does not have it — but a build from a working directory would bake it in.
# Leaving it out is also correct, not just smaller: Store falls back to
# data/catalog/catalog.jsonl as its base layer, so an empty data/db still
# serves all 572 courses. Verified 2026-09-16. The Dockerfile mkdir's it.
data/db/

# NOT excluded, deliberately: data/catalog/ is what this image serves. It holds
# catalog.jsonl + catalog.meta.json, the nightly pipeline's only two outputs.
# Mount over /app/data/catalog to serve a newer build — see DEPLOY.md.
# 29 MB, and it holds LIVE Citrix session cookies. This must never be baked
# into a shared image — it is gitignored for the same reason.
data/.browser_profile/
**/.browser_profile/

# One student's identity: program, year, term, selected courses. A hosted
# instance has no single student; the UI keeps its state in localStorage.
data/profile.json

# --- tests -----------------------------------------------------------------
tests/
.pytest_cache/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# --- vcs and tooling -------------------------------------------------------
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github/
.venv/
venv/
.idea/
.vscode/

# --- source documents ------------------------------------------------------
# The college's own shnaton PDFs, ~3.2 MB. data/curricula.json is the parsed
# product and is what the app actually reads, so the PDFs stay out.
*.pdf
Screenshot.png

# --- docs ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Kept out of the image, not out of the repo. DEPLOY.md is deliberately NOT in
# this list: it is worth having next to the thing it describes.
BRIEFING.md
DEVELOPMENT_LOG.md
DEFERRED.md
SPEC_*.md
ui-overhaul-prompt.md
docs/

# --- local artefacts -------------------------------------------------------
schedule.html
*.log
.env
.env.*
